  "bio": "Embark on a journey into the artistry of black and gray at Shipwrecked Ink, Huntington Beach’s premier tattoo studio where the lines between creativity and mastery are blurred. Operating Monday to Friday from noon until the last satisfied customer sails away, this appointment-based haven invites you to text or DM for inquiries and warmly opens its doors to talented guest artists. Discover your next tattoo treasure in a space where innovation meets tradition, and every design tells a story.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Huntington Beach, California, United States",
